    "description": "The data is collected from the [`PointMaze_UMaze-v3`](https://robotics.farama.org/envs/maze/point_maze/) environment, which contains a U shape maze. The agent uses a PD controller to follow a path of waypoints generated with QIteration until it reaches the goal. The task is continuing which means that when the agent reaches the goal the environment generates a new random goal without resetting the location of the agent. The reward function is sparse, only returning a value of 1 if the goal is reached, otherwise 0. To add variance to the collected paths random noise is added to the actions taken by the agent.",
